{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13216090","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13216090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1321609001:0":{"text":"데미, 말한 두 군데 모두 당신의 집이 아니에요.","source_cn":"德米，你说的两个地方都不是你家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9A7A03B00334691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321609002:1":{"text":"아니야... 우리 집...","source_cn":"不是……我家……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3862D04C4ACE18BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321609003:0":{"text":"그쵸. 이곳은 집이라기보다 당신과 동생이 몰래 빠져나와 모험하던 곳인 것 같아요. 당신도 계속 말하고 있잖아요? 이 근처는 살아있는 시체가 자주 나타나서 위험하다고.","source_cn":"是啊。比起你家，这里更像是你和你妹妹偷偷跑出来冒险的地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ECCDA5E0967AFB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321609004:0":{"text":"마을 주민들은 대부분 시더 마을 근처에 살고 있어요. 시더 마을에 대한 기억은 없나요?","source_cn":"一般来说，民居应该都是雪松镇附近。你对雪松镇有没有印象？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0E65C7892FCA36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321609005:1":{"text":"시더 마을...\n이름... 기억 나, 광장에... 사람이 많았어...","source_cn":"雪松镇……\\n我……记得名字，记得……广场上，很多人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36993A8C515067A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321609006:0":{"text":"음, 이렇게 물어봐도 알아낼 수 있는 게 없으니... <style=\"highlight\">시더 마을</style>로 가보는 게 좋겠어요! 그곳에 도착하면 무언가 생각날지도 모르잖아요!","source_cn":"唔，光是这样问也问不出来什么……还是去一趟<style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4BE12566B375BDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:幽灵德米":{"text":"유령 데미","source":"幽灵德米","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}